        "image_position": "right",
        "eyebrow": "04 — Compact & Connected",
        "title": "Apartment-friendly. AI-coached. Free, forever.",
        "text_1": "Despite its power, the RS03 is remarkably compact. Folded, it measures just 109 \u00d7 35 cm \u2014 smaller than a folding chair. The motorised system operates under 45 dB, making it suitable for apartment living at any hour.",
